2004-09-30  Inge Wallin  <inge@lysator.liu.se>	

	Basically, copy everything from HEAD, since the bugs are not
	possible to fix without the massive rewriting that HEAD has gone
	through.
	
	* Fix bug 30272 Error picking winner when both players have 2-pair hands
	* Fix bug 70903 kpoker identifies only one pair
	* Fix bug 71693 all cards are blinking (computer have just two pairs) 
	* Fix bug 88548: Kpoker: When you save a game and then immediately
	quit, kpoker asks if you want to save the game anyway
	* Fix bug 88584: Use proper poker terminology everywhere


Version 0.7 (Andreas Beckermann <b_mann@gmx.de>)

- added computer player
- fixed some bugs, added many more 
- added bet/raise
- added a QGroupBox for every player
- improved status
- added possibility to start the game without installing
- added an optionsdialog
- added further options which are not in the dialog
- moved clickToHold and LHLabel to the new statusbar
- started API documenting 
- much more

